{
  "schemaVersion": "0.1",
  "name": "Trend Pullback Composite",
  "description": "Uptrend state (EMA 21 above EMA 89), a pullback (RSI at or below 45 on one of the last 5 bars), then RSI crossing back above 45 on a closed bar.",
  "overlay": true,
  "changelog": [
    {
      "date": "2026-10-04",
      "en": "Functional fix: the old condition needed the EMA 21 / 89 cross-up event and RSI at or below 45 on the same bar, which almost never happens (BSV test data: never). Now: trend state EMA 21 above EMA 89, pullback = RSI at or below 45 on one of the last 5 bars (bars is editable), trigger = RSI crosses back above 45 on a closed bar. With both levels at 45 the cross already implies the pullback; lower the pullback level (rsi_pullback_level) to require a deeper dip. Download the starters again.",
      "ja": "機能の修正：以前の条件は、EMA 21／89の上抜けの瞬間とRSI 45以下が同じ足で起きることを求めていて、ほとんど成立しませんでした（BSVのテストデータでは一度も成立せず）。新しい条件：トレンド状態はEMA 21がEMA 89より上、押し目は直近5本のどこかでRSIが45以下（本数は変更できます）、トリガーは確定足でRSIが45を上抜けたとき。どちらの水準も45のままだと、上抜けの時点で押し目の条件も満たされます。より深い押し目を求めるときは押し目の水準（rsi_pullback_level）を下げてください。ひな形はダウンロードし直してください。"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "ema_fast",
      "type": "indicator.ema",
      "params": {
        "source": "close",
        "length": 21
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ema_slow",
      "type": "indicator.ema",
      "params": {
        "source": "close",
        "length": 89
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rsi",
      "type": "indicator.rsi",
      "params": {
        "source": "close",
        "length": 14
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trend_up",
      "type": "signal.threshold",
      "params": {
        "left": "ema_fast",
        "op": ">",
        "right": "ema_slow"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rsi_pullback_level",
      "type": "signal.threshold",
      "params": {
        "left": "rsi",
        "op": "<=",
        "value": 45
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pullback",
      "type": "signal.recent",
      "params": {
        "signal": "rsi_pullback_level",
        "bars": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rsi_above_trigger",
      "type": "signal.threshold",
      "params": {
        "left": "rsi",
        "op": ">",
        "value": 45
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rsi_at_or_below_trigger",
      "type": "signal.threshold",
      "params": {
        "left": "rsi",
        "op": "<=",
        "value": 45
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "below_trigger_before",
      "type": "signal.recent",
      "params": {
        "signal": "rsi_at_or_below_trigger",
        "bars": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger",
      "type": "signal.combine",
      "params": {
        "mode": "all",
        "signals": [
          "rsi_above_trigger",
          "below_trigger_before"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "setup",
      "type": "signal.combine",
      "params": {
        "mode": "all",
        "signals": [
          "trend_up",
          "pullback",
          "trigger"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "plot_fast",
      "type": "visual.plot",
      "params": {
        "source": "ema_fast",
        "title": "EMA 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "plot_slow",
      "type": "visual.plot",
      "params": {
        "source": "ema_slow",
        "title": "EMA 89"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "alert",
      "type": "alert.condition",
      "params": {
        "when": "setup",
        "message": "BSV recipe: trend pullback setup"
      }
    }
  ]
}
